OL,3,AAntisemitism on the rise at
OL,4,Auniversities, charity warns
OL,5,
OL,6,FCases of antisemitism affecting
OL,7,Funiversity students and staff in the UK
OL,8,Fincreased in the last academic year,
OL,9,Faccording to a charity that monitors
OL,10,Fantisemitic incidents.
OL,12,FThe Community Security Trust (CST) said
OL,13,Fit had recorded 95 "university-related"
OL,14,Fincidents in the 2025-26 academic year
OL,15,F- up from 83 the year before.
OL,17,FIt said the number had fallen from its
OL,18,Fpeak in the year after Hamas attacked
OL,19,FIsrael on 7 October 2023 and the war in
OL,20,FGaza began, but remains "substantially
OL,21,Fhigher" than before that point.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
