OL,3,AAntisemitism on the rise at
OL,4,Auniversities, charity warns
OL,5,
OL,6,FUniversities UK (UUK) represents more
OL,7,Fthan 140 institutions and said its
OL,8,Fmembers needed to "protect Jewish
OL,9,Fstudents and staff", adding that the
OL,10,Ffindings were a "serious concern".
